.TH ferry-localsend 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-localsend \- Send files to LocalSend apps (iPhone, iPad, Mac, …) and find them on the local network
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry localsend\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Send files to LocalSend apps (iPhone, iPad, Mac, …) and find them on the local network
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ferry\-localsend\-scan(1)
List the LocalSend apps on the local network. Announces this device\*(Aqs name to them once, so they answer
.TP
ferry\-localsend\-send(1)
Send files and folders to a LocalSend app. Its name is not verified: anyone on the network can announce any name
.TP
ferry\-localsend\-text(1)
Send a text or a link to a LocalSend app, which shows it as a message
